01915 :step/next "step-4300152a-9d2e-58c9-8a25-583173e89e5b" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id "step-4300152a-9d2e-58c9-8a25-583173e89e5b" :step/id #uuid "4300152a-9d2e-58c9-8a25-583173e89e5b" :step/content "question-4a3ed51c-6c18-5fdf-aaa4-d46ab866edd6" :db/ensure [:step/validate]} [:db/retract 17592186165255 :answer-field/choices 17592186165256] [:db/retract 17592186165255 :answer-field/choices 17592186165257] [:db/retract 17592186165255 :answer-field/choices 17592186165258] [:db/retract 17592186165255 :answer-field/choices 17592186165259] [:db/retract 17592186165255 :answer-field/choices 17592186165260] [:db/retract 17592186165416 :answer-field/choices 17592186165417] [:db/retract 17592186165416 :answer-field/choices 17592186165418] [:db/retract 17592186165416 :answer-field/choices 17592186165419] [:db/retract 17592186165416 :answer-field/choices 17592186165420] [:db/retract 17592186165416 :answer-field/choices 17592186165421] [:db/retract 17592186165267 :answer-field/choices 17592186165268] [:db/retract 17592186165267 :answer-field/choices 17592186165269] [:db/retract 17592186165267 :answer-field/choices 17592186165270] [:db/retract 17592186165267 :answer-field/choices 17592186165271] [:db/retract 17592186165267 :answer-field/choices 17592186165272] [:db/retract 17592186165273 :answer-field/choices 17592186165274] [:db/retract 17592186165273 :answer-field/choices 17592186165275] [:db/retract 17592186165273 :answer-field/choices 17592186165276] [:db/retract 17592186165273 :answer-field/choices 17592186165277] [:db/retract 17592186165273 :answer-field/choices 17592186165278] {:db/id 17592186166761 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-58b4a157-5f9c-5f77-a21d-1b131c8f0140" "question-e0bc8c85-75bd-5d02-9581-c62ed55b672c" "question-b84615c0-35fb-546b-b311-f278e0c613e8"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166599 :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nFind the derivative of $y = 3\\sech{x}+\\coth{x}.$" :question/worked-solution "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nFirst, we recall the results for the derivatives of the basic reciprocal hyperbolic functions:\n\n$$\n( \\sech x )' = -\\sech x\\tanh x,\n\\quad \n( \\csch x )' = -\\csch x \\coth x,\n\\quad \n( \\coth x )' = -\\csch^2 x\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the given function using these results and the rules of differentiation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(3\\operatorname{sech}⁡x+\\operatorname{coth}⁡x) \\\\  & =3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{sech}⁡x)+\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{coth}⁡x) \\\\  & =3(-\\operatorname{sech}⁡x\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x)+(-{csch}^{2}⁡x) \\\\  & =-3\\operatorname{sech}⁡x\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x-{csch}^{2}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166762 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-6703e5b6-66a0-5cda-938a-ed7160c9206e" "question-51513d5e-ca42-5754-a902-1af12bc25041" "question-b9b1e144-f837-55bf-a0c3-8113231511af" "question-6866b59d-bbba-56df-8e9c-26cc543fc023" "question-76beb3b0-dbd8-5192-b70b-0a4bac401337"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166600 :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nFind the derivative of $f(x) =\\coth(5x - 2).$" :question/worked-solution "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nFirst, we express $f(x)$ as a composite function:\n\n$$\nf =\\coth{g}, \\qquad g = 5x - 2\n$$\n\nThe chain rule states that\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}f} {\\textrm{d}x} = \\dfrac {\\textrm{d}f} {\\textrm{d}g} \\cdot \\dfrac {\\textrm{d}g} {\\textrm{d}x}.\n$$\n\nDifferentiating, we have\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}f} {\\textrm{d}g}  = -\\csch^2{g},\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\dfrac {\\textrm{d}g} {\\textrm{d}x} = 5.\n$$\n\nFinally, multiplying the two results together and substituting for $g$ gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}f}{\\text{d}x} & =-{csch}^{2}⁡g\\cdot 5 \\\\  & =-5{csch}^{2}⁡g \\\\  & =-5{csch}^{2}⁡(5x-2).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166763 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-05fabaa5-d0f1-544a-aecb-26138b15f8e2" "question-ca80da50-025a-555f-9c99-42892fcfd87d" "question-598d9b4b-1def-5b7e-8724-7abe41dc985d" "question-7b044358-869c-54b8-ba0e-868b6f91f848"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166601 :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nFind the derivative of $f(x) = x^2\\coth{x}.$" :question/worked-solution "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nHere, we have the product of two functions $u(x) = x^2$ and $v(x) = \\coth{x}.$ So, we apply the product rule:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={({x}^{2})}^{′}\\cdot \\operatorname{coth}⁡x+{x}^{2}\\cdot {(\\operatorname{coth}⁡x)}^{′} \\\\  & =2x\\cdot \\operatorname{coth}⁡x+{x}^{2}\\cdot (-{csch}^{2}⁡x) \\\\  & =x(2\\operatorname{coth}⁡x-x{csch}^{2}⁡x)\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166764 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-6cac54f6-b1ee-5704-8eb2-39e7e0d78de0" "question-8386701e-f444-5c82-8928-9b7b2e5dd7d5" "question-9031fff8-a36e-5cc9-9588-e90f1f428aa9" "question-d2bf0ce7-0ebf-56f9-bf0e-f167e2403753"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id 17592186166602 :question/problem "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nFind the derivative of $f(x) = \\dfrac{\\sech{x}}{4x}.$" :question/worked-solution "$\\newcommand{\\arsinh}{\\mathop{\\rm arsinh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcosh}{\\mathop{\\rm arcosh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\artanh}{\\mathop{\\rm artanh}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\sech}{\\mathop{\\rm sech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\csch}{\\mathop{\\rm csch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\coth}{\\mathop{\\rm coth}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arsech}{\\mathop{\\rm arsech}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcsch}{\\mathop{\\rm arcsch}\\nolimits}\n\\newcommand{\\arcoth}{\\mathop{\\rm arcoth}\\nolimits}$\n\nIn this case, the expression for $f(x)$ is a quotient $\\dfrac{u(x)}{v(x)}$ with $u(x) = \\sech{x}$ and $v(x) = 4x.$ \n\nTherefore, we apply the quotient rule as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{{(\\operatorname{sech}⁡x)}^{′}\\cdot (4x)-\\operatorname{sech}⁡x\\cdot {(4x)}^{′}}{{(4x)}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{(-\\operatorname{sech}⁡x\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x)\\cdot (4x)-\\operatorname{sech}⁡x\\cdot 4}{16{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{4\\operatorname{sech}⁡x(x\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+1)}{16{x}^{2}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\operatorname{sech}⁡x(x\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x+1)}{4{x}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "question-58b4a157-5f9c-5f77-a21d-1b131c8f0140" :question/id #uuid "58b4a157-5f9c-5f77-a21d-1b131c8f0140" :question/math-academy-id "q-95450" :question/problem "$$\n\nFind the derivative of $y=4\\operatorname{coth}⁡x-\\operatorname{csch}⁡x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the results for the derivatives of the basic reciprocal hyperbolic functions:\n\n$$\n(\\operatorname{sech}⁡x)^{′}=-\\operatorname{sech}⁡x\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x,\\,(\\operatorname{csch}⁡x)^{′}=-\\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x,\\,(\\operatorname{coth}⁡x)^{′}=-{csch}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the given function using these results, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(4\\operatorname{coth}⁡x-\\operatorname{csch}⁡x) \\\\  & =4\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{coth}⁡x)-\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{csch}⁡x) \\\\  & =4(-{csch}^{2}⁡x)-(-\\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x) \\\\  & =-4{csch}^{2}⁡x+\\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x \\\\  & =\\operatorname{csch}⁡x(-4\\operatorname{csch}⁡x+\\operatorname{coth}⁡x).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-3fcaf6c9-8a15-52b1-a33f-3f4796a6e58a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-3fcaf6c9-8a15-52b1-a33f-3f4796a6e58a" :answer-field/id #uuid "3fcaf6c9-8a15-52b1-a33f-3f4796a6e58a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-8faee535-6239-5c50-8da1-ab3ca13c3eed" :answer-field/choices ["answer-22fc55f5-eece-5862-9495-0d348b157ed8" "answer-46cb26bc-9466-528b-b53b-aa32a469316e" "answer-c42c37da-db11-55f7-a6fa-ee35d397e0ee" "answer-8faee535-6239-5c50-8da1-ab3ca13c3eed" "answer-0fc1200a-020e-579b-aeb4-32e6f6dd2ac7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-22fc55f5-eece-5862-9495-0d348b157ed8" :answer/id #uuid "22fc55f5-eece-5862-9495-0d348b157ed8" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-4{csch}^{2}⁡x+\\operatorname{coth}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-46cb26bc-9466-528b-b53b-aa32a469316e" :answer/id #uuid "46cb26bc-9466-528b-b53b-aa32a469316e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-\\operatorname{csch}⁡x(4\\operatorname{csch}⁡x+\\operatorname{coth}⁡x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-c42c37da-db11-55f7-a6fa-ee35d397e0ee" :answer/id #uuid "c42c37da-db11-55f7-a6fa-ee35d397e0ee" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4{csch}^{2}⁡x-\\operatorname{coth}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-8faee535-6239-5c50-8da1-ab3ca13c3eed" :answer/id #uuid "8faee535-6239-5c50-8da1-ab3ca13c3eed" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{csch}⁡x(-4\\operatorname{csch}⁡x+\\operatorname{coth}⁡x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0fc1200a-020e-579b-aeb4-32e6f6dd2ac7" :answer/id #uuid "0fc1200a-020e-579b-aeb4-32e6f6dd2ac7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{sech}⁡x(4\\operatorname{sech}⁡x-\\operatorname{coth}⁡x)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-e0bc8c85-75bd-5d02-9581-c62ed55b672c" :question/id #uuid "e0bc8c85-75bd-5d02-9581-c62ed55b672c" :question/math-academy-id "q-95481" :question/problem "$$\n\nFind the derivative of $y=6\\operatorname{coth}⁡x.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we recall the results for the derivatives of the basic reciprocal hyperbolic functions:\n\n$$\n(\\operatorname{sech}⁡x)^{′}=-\\operatorname{sech}⁡x\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x,\\,(\\operatorname{csch}⁡x)^{′}=-\\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x,\\,(\\operatorname{coth}⁡x)^{′}=-{csch}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the given function using these results, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(6\\operatorname{coth}⁡x) \\\\  & =6\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{coth}⁡x) \\\\  & =6(-{csch}^{2}⁡x) \\\\  & =-6{csch}^{2}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c1235ebd-5a71-577a-ad30-6fbc32ad0509"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answe