^{′}=-\\operatorname{sech}⁡x\\operatorname{tanh}⁡x,\\,(\\operatorname{csch}⁡x)^{′}=-\\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x,\\,(\\operatorname{coth}⁡x)^{′}=-{csch}^{2}⁡x\n$$\n\nDifferentiating the given function using these results, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-3\\operatorname{csch}⁡x) \\\\  & =-3\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{csch}⁡x) \\\\  & =-3(-\\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x) \\\\  & =3\\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-78bb2f4a-9757-595a-a198-758752968458"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-78bb2f4a-9757-595a-a198-758752968458" :answer-field/id #uuid "78bb2f4a-9757-595a-a198-758752968458" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-490d959f-b059-5325-8c05-c4b0cc600f4c" :answer-field/choices ["answer-58d6b2ae-f213-5a45-acf0-0b0f01d98283" "answer-291fa27b-e8d1-5ed7-8fbf-082f5be7a7e5" "answer-490d959f-b059-5325-8c05-c4b0cc600f4c" "answer-9c149e2c-33ae-5abe-b943-9a619752febc" "answer-73b4e303-9008-5e9e-855f-481e71c7524e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-58d6b2ae-f213-5a45-acf0-0b0f01d98283" :answer/id #uuid "58d6b2ae-f213-5a45-acf0-0b0f01d98283" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3\\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-291fa27b-e8d1-5ed7-8fbf-082f5be7a7e5" :answer/id #uuid "291fa27b-e8d1-5ed7-8fbf-082f5be7a7e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "-3{csch}^{2}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-490d959f-b059-5325-8c05-c4b0cc600f4c" :answer/id #uuid "490d959f-b059-5325-8c05-c4b0cc600f4c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\operatorname{csch}⁡x\\operatorname{coth}⁡x" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9c149e2c-33ae-5abe-b943-9a619752febc" :ans