tep/id #uuid "fd65368b-9f76-5185-9e28-ef7ca924a2b0" :step/content 17592186281339 :db/ensure [:step/validate]} {:db/id 17592186171932 :knowledge-point/questions ["question-09796f32-bb96-5a23-99aa-3f951bba421d"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "question-09796f32-bb96-5a23-99aa-3f951bba421d" :question/id #uuid "09796f32-bb96-5a23-99aa-3f951bba421d" :question/math-academy-id "q-132395" :question/problem "Which digits, when inserted into the blank, make the number $◻46\\,283\\,123$ divisible by $3?$\n\nI. $3$\n\nII. $6$\n\nIII. $9$" :question/worked-solution "A number is divisible by $3$ if the sum of its digits is divisible by $3.$\n\nFor the number $◻46\\,283\\,123$ the sum of the digits is\n\n$$\n◻+4+6+2+8+3+1+2+3=29+◻.\n$$\n\nNow, let's consider each of the given digits that could be inserted into the blank.\n\n- If we insert $3$ into the blank, then the sum of the digits is $29+3=32,$ which is *not* divisible by $3.$\n\n- If we insert $6$ into the blank, then the sum of the digits is $29+6=35,$ which is *not* divisible by $3.$\n\n- If we insert $9$ into the blank, then the sum of the digits is $29+9=38,$ which is *not* divisible by $3.$\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None.\"" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-5a012c9a-24db-583a-bec6-39e67dddf0b8"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-5a012c9a-24db-583a-bec6-39e67dddf0b8" :answer-field/id #uuid "5a012c9a-24db-583a-bec6-39e67dddf0b8" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-db211885-c760-5c9b-82d8-324650fee491" :answer-field/choices ["answer-5ddc1748-c54d-52f9-b83d-77b10b8e524f" "answer-6db19dc0-a972-59c4-8899-534655f444e9" "answer-03d2d098-2a69-510a-81e0-73d1dac134b5" "answer-54e47f42-90e3-5e87-9da0-7121c6f877b1" "answer-db211885-c760-5c9b-82d8-324650fee491"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5ddc1748-c54d-52f9-b83d-77b10b8e524f" :answer/id 